# Fixture for verify/lights_test.py: the parameterized-light shapes the
# airplane-parameterized-light guide documents, one line each.
#   * v12 (R G B INDEX INTENSITY DX DY DZ WIDTH) directional spill and billboard
#   * v12 omni (WIDTH 1, direction 0 0 0)
#   * v11 component billboards (DX DY DZ INDEX SIZE) - no colour, no width
#   * v11 spill (R G B INDEX SIZE DX DY DZ WIDTH, SIZE in metres)
#   * cockpit panel spill, a rotating beacon, a generic spill (full_custom_halo)
#   * one name this add-on has no table for, and one LIGHT_NAMED
# INTENSITY is written without the `cd` suffix Laminar's own files carry: XP2B's
# param validation does float() on every token and cancels the whole export on
# "300000cd" (see docs/import.md), which would mask what this test grades.
POINT_COUNTS	0	0	0	0

LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_landing_pm	1	-0.6	5.9	1	0.95	0.9	0	300000	-0.0868	-0.0872	-0.9924	0.97629601
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_landing_bb	1	-0.6	5.9	1	1	1	0	300000	-0.0868	-0.0872	-0.9924	0.97629601
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_nav_pm	-1.57	0.61	11.97	1	0	0	0	250	0	0	0	1.0
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_taxi_core	0	1	0	0	0	-1	0	0.33
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_taxi_sp	0	-0.64	0.74	1	1	1	0	3.5	0.90630779
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_panel_sp	-0.394	0.552	2.422	1	0.88	0.57	1	1.3	0.1736	-0.9848	0	0.17364822
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_beacon_rotate	0	2.64	12.58	1	0
LIGHT_PARAM	full_custom_halo	-0.07	0.479	4.3	1	0.91	0.79	1	3	-0.0885	-0.9813	-0.171	0.81915205
LIGHT_PARAM	airplane_made_up_lamp	0	1	0	1	0.5	0.5	0	7	0	-1	0	1
LIGHT_NAMED	ship_mast_powered	0	2	0
